&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1. Build Customer Empathy - Regularly engage with customers, internal stakeholders, and ecosystem partners to deeply understand pain points, workflows, and unmet needs through both qualitative and quantitative insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2. Drive Product Strategy - Define long-term product vision and quarterly roadmap aligned with business goals, customer outcomes, and platform scalability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3. Build Scalable Products - Collaborate with engineering, design, analytics, and operations teams to build reliable, scalable, and high-impact products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;4. Lead Product Execution - Write high-quality product specifications, prioritize effectively, manage tradeoffs, and ensure timely execution across releases&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5. Own Metrics &amp;amp; Outcomes - Define success metrics, monitor business impact, and driveiterative improvements through experimentation and data analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;6. Ecosystem Collaboration - Partner with banks, regulators, vendors, and ecosystem players to co-build industry-defining solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are we looking for?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;1. 4–7 years of product management experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2. Strong product execution and prioritization skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;3. Experience owning business metrics and customer outcomes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;4. Strong analytical thinking and experimentation mindset&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5. Ability to work across technical and business stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;6. Systems thinking and platform orientation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7. Strong customer empathy balanced with business acumen&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;8. Ability to thrive in ambiguity and fast-paced environments&lt;/p&gt;
